md='''# Batch101 independent review

Source commit: 4199dfcdb6e93d832b82b341a25935ba59edbc01
Original freeze: 4d913f5b3716975a8310ffc584d3aeb7f4ce75bf65960e05aa067b67145e7659

## Verdicts

- Marchantites r001: FAIL required visual/factual feature. The 24 ventral scales attach correctly, but none of the 132 same-row pairs overlap in XY projection or actual triangles. The nearest projected separation is at least 0.27329 mm. The exact underside image shows spaced pairs, not the frozen imbricate rows. Technical, numeric ranges and immutable-specification binding pass; those do not waive this feature failure.
- Winfrenatia r001: PASS static five stages. Nineteen real pits in a single layered closed mat; source ranges and bounded-fragment caveat preserved.
- Macginitiea r001: PASS static five stages. Twenty-four closed connected leaves each have seven actual radial margin peaks; 21 attached small heads, petioles and source dimensions pass. Whole-tree form remains artistic organ synthesis.
- Protospongia r002: PASS static five stages. Original six decreasing orders retained, all 72 required contacts pass. The exact original-GLB frontal microdetail resolves a cross with its lower ray overlapping the parent. The rejected r001 nub and all original evidence remain preserved. No new full-frame microscopic-legibility gate imposed.

## Minimum repair

Only Marchantites needs geometry work: create a new revision that adjusts ventral scale position/orientation to form genuine readable neighboring imbrication in two rows, while retaining attachment and the original 0.4–0.8 mm width range. Preserve valid ribbon/cup geometry and original r001/freeze. Do not replace “imbricate” with looser wording. Rebind and rerender only the changed subject; request targeted difference QA.

## Independent proof

All 335 changed commit paths (25,624,133 bytes), 22 dependency-closure entries and original freeze hashes match. All four sources were actually reopened and independently reexported byte-identically. Original unmodified GLBs have consistently opposed closed edges and positive signed volumes: 33, 1, 124 and 73 solids respectively. All 246 required parent/tissue contacts pass. Real two-process rebuild provenance and actual output bytes match each final subject. Fresh project, Khronos and Three.js checks pass; Khronos reports zero errors/warnings for each.

Personally inspected 14 source specimen/page images, four concepts, all 32 individual final frames, four verified lossless sheets, five current details, the rejected r001 microdetail and one new exact-GLB frontal microdetail. Global exposure uses actual whole-scene triangles and pixel judgment, not parent-only AABBs or a new exposure percentage threshold.

## Scientific and approval limits

Marchantites fossil panels remain separate from living comparisons. Winfrenatia is a small fragment with uncertain symbiosis. Macginitiea is an associated-organ reconstruction, not an intact fossil tree. Protospongia is the transparently pre-frozen wall fragment, not an invented complete Burgess body.

Three subjects are static-five-stage eligible. None is formally seven-stage approved or approved for website/live release: GPU and composed-scene stages remain UNKNOWN. Original candidate records, sources, queue counts and authority were not changed. No push, PR, merge or publication was performed.

Exact subject triplets, source/generator/config pins, measurements and evidence hashes are in independent-report.json. Integrity/provenance and image-inspection records are separate, immutable evidence.
'''
